flowchart TD
    A[KeyAction tuple] --> B[compile_runtime_intents]
    B --> C[RuntimeSchedule]
    C --> D[PlaybackEngine prewarm/setup]
    D --> E[PlaybackSupervisor]
    E --> F[Control/UI thread]
    E --> G[Python dispatch thread]
    F -->|queue + event| G
    F -->|SharedFocusSignal| G
    G --> H[DispatchLoop wait]
    H --> I[drain pending releases first]
    I --> J[scalar authored drain]
    J --> K[Tracked InputBackend]
    K --> L[ctypes SendInput]
    L --> M[completion timestamp]
    M --> N[Coordinator transition]
    N --> O[Python telemetry]
